{"3595890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warp Knights", "steam_appid": 3595890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity once had a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They called you Commander — the one who led the final stand, who vanished in the last warp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades later, the world you saved has fallen again. Nations fractured, power turned to tyranny, and hope was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you awaken — reborn with the same power that once changed the course of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The operatives, inspired by your legend, now await your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, it’s not about defense — it’s about taking back the world that was stolen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Depth · Real-Time Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/561be5cda5568d5f98d9ea6a6c149277.poster.avif?t=1778037683\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/561be5cda5568d5f98d9ea6a6c149277.webm?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/561be5cda5568d5f98d9ea6a6c149277.mp4?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a living puzzle of timing and positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use cover and terrain, flank enemies, and turn defense into offense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No two battles are the same — your strategy, your choices, your outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters You Truly Connect With</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’re more than just operatives — each carries emotions, memories, and a story waiting to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/53ce6f18a808672212fa9f7221191c42.poster.avif?t=1778037683\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/53ce6f18a808672212fa9f7221191c42.webm?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/53ce6f18a808672212fa9f7221191c42.mp4?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They don’t just fight for you; they fight with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3D Operatives · Real Presence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/55b449bc29b4b87249538a35c0715567.poster.avif?t=1778037683\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/55b449bc29b4b87249538a35c0715567.webm?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/55b449bc29b4b87249538a35c0715567.mp4?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command over 40 3D operatives, each with unique abilities, charm, and tactical roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form your team, experiment with limitless combinations, and experience their presence on the field — alive, responsive, and fighting by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card-Based Combat · Warp Strikes in Motion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/d086953d7bee32154b8bac5a015086d2.poster.avif?t=1778037683\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/d086953d7bee32154b8bac5a015086d2.webm?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/d086953d7bee32154b8bac5a015086d2.mp4?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy units and trigger warp abilities using a card-based tactical system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Manage resources, plan warp strikes, and witness your commands unfold with real-time feedback and explosive precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Sci-Fi Epic of Return and Resolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/ee515f8f66758af900a358912bac53fa.poster.avif?t=1778037683\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/ee515f8f66758af900a358912bac53fa.webm?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your operatives through a world of advanced warfare and fractured alliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Reclaim what was lost — not as a legend of the past, but as the Commander reborn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They called you a hero. Now, be one again.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity once had a hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They called you Commander — the one who led the final stand, who vanished in the last warp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades later, the world you saved has fallen again. Nations fractured, power turned to tyranny, and hope was lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you awaken — reborn with the same power that once changed the course of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The operatives, inspired by your legend, now await your command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, it’s not about defense — it’s about taking back the world that was stolen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tactical Depth · Real-Time Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/561be5cda5568d5f98d9ea6a6c149277.poster.avif?t=1778037683\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/561be5cda5568d5f98d9ea6a6c149277.webm?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595890/extras/561be5cda5568d5f98d9ea6a6c149277.mp4?t=1778037683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is a living puzzle of timing and positioning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use cover and terrain, flank enemies, and turn defense into offense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No two battles are the same — your strategy, your choices, your outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Characters You Truly Connect With</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’re more than just operatives — each carries emotions, memories, and a story waiting to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359589